# ...except the deterministic component map, which a frozen manifest binds
# by hash. A hash without its artifact is not portable evidence: the map is
# written with a fixed gzip mtime and hashed over decompressed canonical
# content, so it is byte-reproducible and safe to track.
!specs/evidence/asd-component-map.jsonl.gz
